{
    "description": "MelCloud ATA AC — payload captured LIVE from HA (`climate.salon`, platform melcloud, supported_features 937). Pins two real-world facts: (1) the mode lives in the entity STATE ('fan_only') and HA never exposes hvac_mode in state_attributes, so it must be DERIVED, never read from an attribute; (2) this integration reports no hvac_action, so no such readout may be advertised. Vocabulary, option lists and ranges are the live ones (min_temp 10, max_temp 31, step 0.5, fan_modes 1..4); drifting readings and the device identifiers are representative. Drives the premium 'clim' panel.",
    "provider": "homeassistant",
    "entity": {
